WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.166
In pursuit of his eighth Kalos Gym badge

2
00:00:04.233 --> 00:00:05.700
and entry into the Kalos League,

3
00:00:05.766 --> 00:00:09.833
Ash challenged Gym Leader Wulfric at the ice-type Snowbelle Gym.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.833
However, our hero was roundly defeated.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.466
With the burden of doubt on their shoulders,

6
00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:19.900
Ash and Greninja disappeared separately into the forest.

7
00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:23.466
But along with great challenge comes great growth,

8
00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:28.666
as the two of them finally learned how to harness the true power of Ash-Greninja.

9
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:35.233
Now, with renewed spirit, Ash prepares for his rematch to earn his final badge.

10
00:00:37.233 --> 00:00:38.300
Hey, Ash?

11
00:00:40.266 --> 00:00:42.533
It's okay. I know what to do.

12
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.566
I see the way to go.

13
00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:45.766
Mm-hm.

14
00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:48.900
Now's the time to go and win your eighth gym badge.

15
00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:52.800
Right. Excuse me, but I'd like a gym battle.

16
00:00:53.466 --> 00:00:56.400
A rematch, huh? We've been waiting for you.

17
00:01:05.366 --> 00:01:08.600
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

18
00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.233
♪ Knock me down, I'll just get up again ♪

19
00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:16.300
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

20
00:01:16.366 --> 00:01:19.366
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

21
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:20.533
♪ Gotta catch 'em all!

22
00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.933
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

23
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.033
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

24
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.566
♪ Gotta catch 'em all! ♪

25
00:01:33.533 --> 00:01:35.633
"A Real Icebreaker!"

26
00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.266
Well, well, back for another match?

27
00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:51.266
Yeah.

28
00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:52.600
How are you?

29
00:01:53.533 --> 00:01:55.433
After our last battle...

30
00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:04.066
I shouldn't have worried. You know what? Forget my last question.

31
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.200
All right, shall we begin?

32
00:02:08.233 --> 00:02:10.233
No doubt you're a fiery one.

33
00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.233
Let's see if your fire's enough to melt my icy resolve.

34
00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:14.533
- But, sir...
- Huh?

35
00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:18.400
- I haven't stated the rules yet.
- It's fine. It's fine.

36
00:02:18.466 --> 00:02:21.033
We just battled, so... Right?

37
00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.533
Right. Let's get this show on the road.

38
00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.233
Exactly.

39
00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.733
Excuse me, but this is an official battle.

40
00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.466
Don't get lost in the details. You know what?

41
00:02:30.533 --> 00:02:33.700
Whoever loses three Pokémon loses the match, right?

42
00:02:33.766 --> 00:02:35.966
- Simple, right?
- Right.

43
00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:37.700
Wulfric sure is bold.

44
00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.466
He can hardly wait to get the battle started.

45
00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:43.833
You know what? Let's begin.

46
00:02:48.533 --> 00:02:49.466
Bergmite.

47
00:02:49.533 --> 00:02:51.666
Pika. Pika, pika!

48
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:54.466
It's a Bergmite.

49
00:02:54.533 --> 00:02:56.266
He didn't use it last time.

50
00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:58.800
I wonder how Bergmite's going to attack.

51
00:02:59.233 --> 00:03:01.700
Okay, Pikachu. You're up, buddy.

52
00:03:01.766 --> 00:03:03.366
Pika, pika!

53
00:03:03.433 --> 00:03:05.900
All right then, battle begin!

54
00:03:09.433 --> 00:03:11.600
Here goes. Electro Ball!

55
00:03:16.866 --> 00:03:20.266
- I knew Bergmite would slide.
- Now, Icy Wind.

56
00:03:21.566 --> 00:03:22.800
Pikachu, heads up!

57
00:03:22.866 --> 00:03:24.033
Pika, pika!

58
00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.266
Keep it up with Quick Attack.

59
00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:35.166
Pika!

60
00:03:37.433 --> 00:03:38.266
Pika?

61
00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:40.800
Hey, what's wrong?

62
00:03:40.866 --> 00:03:44.766
An additional effect from the Icy Wind. Keep an eye on Pikachu.

63
00:03:46.333 --> 00:03:49.900
Icy Wind is chilling Pikachu's body and slowing it down.

64
00:03:51.266 --> 00:03:53.866
Okay. Pikachu, Thunderbolt.

65
00:03:55.233 --> 00:03:57.700
Pikachu!

66
00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.900
So, Pikachu is still moving quickly.

67
00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:08.400
You know, Bergmite, your specialty. Use Sharpen.

68
00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:14.533
Bergmite. Bergmite! Berg, berg, berg!

69
00:04:14.966 --> 00:04:15.900
What's Sharpen?

70
00:04:16.533 --> 00:04:17.533
Pika, pika?

71
00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.800
- Sharpen?
- What's that do?

72
00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.466
It's a move that sharpens Bergmite's body

73
00:04:22.533 --> 00:04:24.433
and increases attack power.

74
00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.066
Now, Rapid Spin.

75
00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.600
Bergmite, berg!

76
00:04:29.666 --> 00:04:31.200
Pikachu, dodge!

77
00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:41.766
Pikachu, no!

78
00:04:42.133 --> 00:04:44.066
Pikachu's really slowing down.

79
00:04:44.133 --> 00:04:45.233
All those attacks.

80
00:04:45.566 --> 00:04:46.833
What will Ash do now?

81
00:04:50.266 --> 00:04:53.300
Got it. Run around and around and around.

82
00:04:53.366 --> 00:04:54.366
Pika!

83
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.133
What's going on?

84
00:05:05.733 --> 00:05:08.133
- Yeah! Looking good.
- What?

85
00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.766
- Of course.
- What do you mean, "of course"?

86
00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:14.433
The increased body temperature melted the ice on Pikachu's body.

87
00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.866
Looks like it's also melting Wulfric's Icy Resolve.

88
00:05:17.933 --> 00:05:19.300
Fascinating.

89
00:05:19.633 --> 00:05:21.366
Now, Bergmite, again.

90
00:05:21.433 --> 00:05:22.933
Use Rapid Spin!

91
00:05:23.366 --> 00:05:25.900
Berg, berg, Bergmite!

92
00:05:25.966 --> 00:05:27.633
Pikachu, use Quick Attack.

93
00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:29.633
Pika!

94
00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:32.933
Now use Iron Tail.

95
00:05:34.466 --> 00:05:36.900
Pika!

96
00:05:36.966 --> 00:05:39.466
Berg, Bergmite, berg.

97
00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.166
Impressive.

98
00:05:46.233 --> 00:05:49.766
Bergmite is unable to battle and Pikachu is the winner.

99
00:05:49.833 --> 00:05:51.866
- Pikachu!
- Awesome!

100
00:05:51.933 --> 00:05:54.100
- Yay, Pikachu!
- Denne!

101
00:05:54.166 --> 00:05:55.866
So different than before.

102
00:05:55.933 --> 00:05:57.900
Yeah. Ash is back.

103
00:05:58.933 --> 00:06:00.400
The Ash I know.

104
00:06:01.966 --> 00:06:03.300
Bergmite, return.

105
00:06:05.466 --> 00:06:08.533
You know what? I was waiting for that kind of fire.

106
00:06:09.466 --> 00:06:11.566
Avalugg, you're up next.

107
00:06:16.233 --> 00:06:19.266
- Avalugg!
- Pika!

108
00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:22.833
You know what? It's time to really turn up the heat, challenger.

109
00:06:23.266 --> 00:06:26.000
Right. I'm gonna turn it way up and then win.

110
00:06:26.066 --> 00:06:27.966
Pika, pika!

111
00:06:28.033 --> 00:06:30.800
You ready, Pikachu? Thunderbolt.

112
00:06:30.866 --> 00:06:33.300
Pikachu!

113
00:06:36.466 --> 00:06:37.666
Avalugg, Avalanche.

114
00:06:38.633 --> 00:06:40.666
Avalugg!

115
00:06:44.966 --> 00:06:45.966
Pika!

116
00:06:47.533 --> 00:06:49.233
Now, slide and dodge.

117
00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.300
Pika!

118
00:06:51.666 --> 00:06:52.766
I expected that.

119
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.266
Avalugg, Gyro Ball.

120
00:06:57.066 --> 00:06:59.366
- Avalugg!
- Pika?

121
00:06:59.433 --> 00:07:01.633
Use Iron Tail on the battlefield.

122
00:07:07.833 --> 00:07:10.033
- Awesome!
- Now, Stone Edge.

123
00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:12.366
- Avalugg!
- Pika?

124
00:07:13.066 --> 00:07:14.066
Pika!

125
00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:15.633
Quick, Thunderbolt!

126
00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:19.233
Pikachu!

127
00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.033
Pika!

128
00:07:24.733 --> 00:07:25.766
No!

129
00:07:25.833 --> 00:07:27.766
Pikachu is unable to battle.

130
00:07:27.833 --> 00:07:29.300
Avalugg is the winner!

131
00:07:29.366 --> 00:07:31.500
Avalugg.

132
00:07:34.166 --> 00:07:36.500
Great job, buddy. You're the best.

133
00:07:38.733 --> 00:07:40.000
Pika.

134
00:07:40.066 --> 00:07:42.866
Please. I need more heat than that.

135
00:07:43.533 --> 00:07:46.166
So, who's your second Pokémon?

136
00:07:47.866 --> 00:07:49.366
It's right in here.

137
00:07:49.433 --> 00:07:50.933
Go, Talonflame!

138
00:07:55.833 --> 00:07:57.300
Interesting.

139
00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:00.866
All your Pokémon have such fire in their eyes.

140
00:08:00.933 --> 00:08:02.866
Watch this. Use Flame Charge!

141
00:08:02.933 --> 00:08:07.833
Talonflame!

142
00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:11.700
Avalugg, Stone Edge.

143
00:08:14.133 --> 00:08:16.666
Talon... flame. Talon... flame.

144
00:08:17.133 --> 00:08:19.066
Talon... flame!

145
00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.566
Now, then, did you feel the power in that?

146
00:08:21.633 --> 00:08:24.166
Talonflame, flame!

147
00:08:24.566 --> 00:08:27.066
Okay, Talonflame. Steel Wing, let's go.

148
00:08:27.133 --> 00:08:28.266
Flame!

149
00:08:28.333 --> 00:08:30.700
Talon... flame!

150
00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.766
Talon!

151
00:08:36.433 --> 00:08:37.900
Avalugg!

152
00:08:37.966 --> 00:08:39.299
Still standing.

153
00:08:39.366 --> 00:08:40.766
Now, that's some power.

154
00:08:41.299 --> 00:08:42.500
Use Avalanche.

155
00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.166
Talon!

156
00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.666
Talon...

157
00:08:50.733 --> 00:08:52.300
Burn it up, Talonflame.

158
00:08:52.366 --> 00:08:53.733
Use Flame Charge.

159
00:08:55.633 --> 00:08:56.600
Flame!

160
00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:04.533
Flame!

161
00:09:05.166 --> 00:09:07.500
Now, that's a powerful move.

162
00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:10.833
Avalugg's unable to battle.

163
00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.433
Talonflame's the winner.

164
00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.300
Great job, Talonflame.

165
00:09:14.366 --> 00:09:15.200
Pika, pika!

166
00:09:15.266 --> 00:09:17.600
Talonflame!

167
00:09:18.766 --> 00:09:21.300
So, that means Ash has two wins now.

168
00:09:21.366 --> 00:09:25.633
- Mm-hm. He's gonna win this time.
- But this is no time for overconfidence.

169
00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.100
Avalugg, return.

170
00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:32.166
Trust in your Pokémon, and there's no limit to what you can achieve.

171
00:09:32.233 --> 00:09:34.600
Right. I totally believe in them.

172
00:09:35.366 --> 00:09:37.866
I want to learn more about you.

173
00:09:37.933 --> 00:09:41.666
All right, Abomasnow, let's go!

174
00:09:44.633 --> 00:09:47.566
Aboma... Abomasnow!

175
00:09:50.633 --> 00:09:52.900
Talon...

176
00:09:52.966 --> 00:09:54.866
- Abomasnow's last.
- Pika.

177
00:09:54.933 --> 00:09:57.300
Show me more of who you really are.

178
00:09:57.366 --> 00:10:00.466
Right. Now, Talonflame, Steel Wing.

179
00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.033
Talon!

180
00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.533
Wood Hammer!

181
00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.633
- Abomasnow!
- Flame--!

182
00:10:11.066 --> 00:10:14.033
- Oh, no!
- So, you want to defeat me?

183
00:10:14.233 --> 00:10:16.266
The battle's beginning now.

184
00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:17.866
Talonflame, Flame Charge, go!

185
00:10:17.933 --> 00:10:20.233
Talonflame!

186
00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.000
Abomasnow, Ice Shard.

187
00:10:22.066 --> 00:10:25.533
Abomasnow!

188
00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.266
Talon... Talonflame!

189
00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:30.066
Now use Wood Hammer.

190
00:10:30.133 --> 00:10:32.133
- Abomasnow!
- Flame--!

191
00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.366
Talonflame, no!

192
00:10:33.433 --> 00:10:35.033
Talonflame!

193
00:10:38.133 --> 00:10:39.166
Flame...

194
00:10:39.233 --> 00:10:41.166
Talonflame's unable to battle.

195
00:10:41.233 --> 00:10:42.866
Abomasnow is the winner.

196
00:10:43.666 --> 00:10:45.366
Pika.

197
00:10:45.433 --> 00:10:49.700
Even using Talonflame, Ash couldn't defeat Abomasnow with speed.

198
00:10:49.766 --> 00:10:53.200
They skillfully closed any escape routes using Ice Shard.

199
00:10:54.866 --> 00:10:57.133
That gym leader isn't fooling around.

200
00:10:58.666 --> 00:11:02.466
You battled hard. I'll make sure it doesn't go to waste.

201
00:11:04.133 --> 00:11:06.133
Time for my last Pokémon.

202
00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:09.966
Now it's time for you to see our true power.

203
00:11:10.033 --> 00:11:11.500
Greninja, I choose you.

204
00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.100
Oh, here we go.

205
00:11:16.166 --> 00:11:17.766
I've been waiting for you.

206
00:11:17.833 --> 00:11:20.566
All right, Greninja. Aerial ace.

207
00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.000
Greninja!

208
00:11:26.633 --> 00:11:27.966
Water Shuriken!

209
00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:37.800
Energy Ball.

210
00:11:38.033 --> 00:11:39.733
Aboma!

211
00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.700
Use Cut.

212
00:11:40.766 --> 00:11:44.800
Gren... ninja!

213
00:11:49.566 --> 00:11:51.033
Use Wood Hammer!

214
00:11:52.566 --> 00:11:54.366
Aboma!

215
00:11:55.033 --> 00:11:56.866
Abomasnow!

216
00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:58.533
Quick, block it!

217
00:12:01.833 --> 00:12:03.466
Aboma?

218
00:12:15.366 --> 00:12:16.200
Ninja?

219
00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.900
Mm-hm.

220
00:12:17.966 --> 00:12:20.366
Now, Greninja, together!

221
00:12:32.133 --> 00:12:34.300
Who's that Pokémon?

222
00:12:39.466 --> 00:12:40.966
It's Avalugg!

223
00:12:41.033 --> 00:12:44.000
Avalugg!

224
00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:50.333
Ah!

225
00:12:58.366 --> 00:12:59.500
Grenin.

226
00:12:59.566 --> 00:13:02.200
- Dede!
- A giant water shuriken.

227
00:13:02.266 --> 00:13:03.266
Yeah.

228
00:13:03.333 --> 00:13:06.000
They look so great, so strong.

229
00:13:06.066 --> 00:13:08.033
Yay, Ash-Greninja!

230
00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.100
Dede!

231
00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:15.933
Feel the heat.

232
00:13:16.366 --> 00:13:19.633
We're just getting stronger and stronger and stronger.

233
00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:22.866
You know what? Show me your future, Ash.

234
00:13:22.933 --> 00:13:24.966
I need you to show it to me now.

235
00:13:25.566 --> 00:13:26.400
Aboma!

236
00:13:26.466 --> 00:13:27.766
Aerial ace.

237
00:13:29.366 --> 00:13:32.900
Greninja, ja, ja!

238
00:13:37.466 --> 00:13:38.600
Wood Hammer!

239
00:13:39.233 --> 00:13:41.000
Aboma!

240
00:13:41.066 --> 00:13:42.700
Okay, Greninja! Cut!

241
00:13:42.766 --> 00:13:44.966
Greninja!

242
00:13:45.033 --> 00:13:48.966
Ninja! Ninja, ninja!

243
00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.500
Ninja!

244
00:13:54.566 --> 00:13:57.133
Aboma!

245
00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:03.500
You know what? It's like a completely different Pokémon than it was before.

246
00:14:05.166 --> 00:14:06.333
Water Shuriken!

247
00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.066
Greninja!

248
00:14:16.333 --> 00:14:18.533
You were here just a few days ago.

249
00:14:18.966 --> 00:14:21.533
How could you have gotten so much stronger?

250
00:14:22.233 --> 00:14:24.433
Working with my Pokémon, that's how.

251
00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.033
Strong together.

252
00:14:26.466 --> 00:14:29.533
I can feel it. The two of you are battling as one.

253
00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:33.500
It's like Greninja woke up a new power that's deep inside of me.

254
00:14:33.566 --> 00:14:37.700
And this challenge is our very first battle in control of our new power!

255
00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:40.166
Yes, it is fully on display.

256
00:14:40.233 --> 00:14:44.766
Your real power, your heat, and your future, so...

257
00:14:45.366 --> 00:14:48.333
You know what? Now I must respond.

258
00:14:50.266 --> 00:14:51.133
A Key Stone!

259
00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:56.033
Bare your fangs, power of ice. It's time to Mega Evolve.

260
00:15:02.166 --> 00:15:05.200
Abomasnow!

261
00:15:05.633 --> 00:15:07.266
It Mega Evolved.

262
00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:08.666
Mega Evolved.

263
00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.866
This is from your heat.

264
00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.000
Your fire is burning bright.

265
00:15:13.633 --> 00:15:17.733
With such an opponent, responding with Mega Evolution is a courtesy.

266
00:15:18.533 --> 00:15:21.366
We'll give it our all. Water Shuriken!

267
00:15:21.433 --> 00:15:22.500
Ninja!

268
00:15:22.933 --> 00:15:23.866
Use Ice Punch!

269
00:15:23.933 --> 00:15:26.900
Abomasnow!

270
00:15:28.066 --> 00:15:29.533
Aboma.

271
00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.400
- Just like that...
- Everything froze.

272
00:15:33.466 --> 00:15:36.000
Mega Evolution increased its power a lot.

273
00:15:36.666 --> 00:15:40.166
It's okay. Ash can do it. I'm sure.

274
00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.000
Now, Ice Shard.

275
00:15:42.066 --> 00:15:44.266
Aboma!

276
00:15:45.766 --> 00:15:46.766
Dodge it!

277
00:15:47.166 --> 00:15:48.866
Ninja!

278
00:15:53.333 --> 00:15:55.166
Greninja, double team!

279
00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.233
- Ninja.
- Ninja.

280
00:15:59.666 --> 00:16:01.433
Now Aerial Ace.

281
00:16:05.133 --> 00:16:06.233
Wood Hammer!

282
00:16:11.733 --> 00:16:15.233
Gre... nin... ja.

283
00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.200
- So strong.
- Pika!

284
00:16:20.633 --> 00:16:21.866
Ice Shard!

285
00:16:21.933 --> 00:16:25.700
Aboma!

286
00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.166
Greninja, Cut, let's go!

287
00:16:28.566 --> 00:16:30.566
Greninja!

288
00:16:33.233 --> 00:16:34.266
Amazing.

289
00:16:36.066 --> 00:16:36.933
Cut again!

290
00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:40.066
Ice Punch!

291
00:16:40.933 --> 00:16:43.233
Abomasnow!

292
00:16:50.266 --> 00:16:51.633
Bring it on.

293
00:16:52.533 --> 00:16:53.700
So, it's like that.

294
00:16:53.766 --> 00:16:54.833
Wood Hammer!

295
00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:56.566
Aboma!

296
00:16:57.466 --> 00:16:59.166
Glide on the frozen blades.

297
00:17:04.866 --> 00:17:05.833
Awesome.

298
00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:07.166
Simply incredible.

299
00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.933
Now what?

300
00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.200
Use Ice Shard.

301
00:17:13.266 --> 00:17:16.133
Aboma!

302
00:17:25.433 --> 00:17:27.599
Now, Water Shuriken.

303
00:17:28.366 --> 00:17:30.033
Ice Punch!

304
00:17:34.866 --> 00:17:36.233
Aerial Ace!

305
00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:51.133
My ice, you broke it.

306
00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.566
Abomasnow is unable to battle.

307
00:18:00.866 --> 00:18:02.833
That makes Greninja the winner.

308
00:18:03.433 --> 00:18:06.633
And that means the match goes to Ash, the challenger!

309
00:18:07.066 --> 00:18:08.633
- Yeah!
- Pika!

310
00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.466
All right!

311
00:18:24.533 --> 00:18:25.933
Congrats, Ash.

312
00:18:27.966 --> 00:18:29.700
Excellent. You did it.

313
00:18:29.766 --> 00:18:31.433
You won your eighth badge.

314
00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.100
Yeah. Thanks a lot.

315
00:18:33.866 --> 00:18:34.733
You, too.

316
00:18:35.066 --> 00:18:39.300
Now, this is the person I admire so much. Welcome back.

317
00:18:48.933 --> 00:18:52.400
- Well, that battle had heat.
- Thanks.

318
00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.500
What was it, Ash-Greninja?

319
00:18:54.866 --> 00:18:58.033
It was strong. I got to see something impressive.

320
00:18:58.533 --> 00:19:01.500
I can give this badge to you with confidence.

321
00:19:02.266 --> 00:19:03.933
Here. Take it.

322
00:19:04.666 --> 00:19:08.533
The, you know, Snowbelle Gym Iceberg Badge.

323
00:19:10.966 --> 00:19:12.266
This is so great.

324
00:19:13.266 --> 00:19:16.366
Wow, I just got the Iceberg Badge!

325
00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:27.100
It's amazing seeing them all there.

326
00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.800
Yeah. It almost takes my breath away.

327
00:19:31.166 --> 00:19:32.766
You know what, young man?

328
00:19:33.133 --> 00:19:35.233
You have all the gym badges now.

329
00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:36.666
One thing left to do.

330
00:19:36.833 --> 00:19:38.500
Head for the Kalos League.

331
00:19:38.566 --> 00:19:39.400
Right.

332
00:19:41.533 --> 00:19:43.800
You're greatly loved by your Pokémon,

333
00:19:43.866 --> 00:19:47.600
and now I see how much you believe in them, so, you know what?

334
00:19:48.033 --> 00:19:50.466
I find myself liking you a lot.

335
00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:53.600
Now see for yourself just how far you can go.

336
00:19:53.666 --> 00:19:54.500
Right.

337
00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:12.533
I wanna thank all of you so much.

338
00:20:12.666 --> 00:20:14.200
Now it starts.

339
00:20:16.733 --> 00:20:19.933
There'll be lots of strong Trainers at the Kalos League.

340
00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.466
Sawyer's waiting for me there, too.

341
00:20:21.533 --> 00:20:23.366
Pika, pikachu!

342
00:20:23.433 --> 00:20:27.933
Yeah! Let's all head there together and move right into number one.

343
00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:33.800
With Ash's hard-earned eighth Kalos Gym badge safely in hand,

344
00:20:33.866 --> 00:20:37.433
it's time for our heroes to look directly toward the Kalos League,

345
00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.400
where powerful rivals and excitement await,

346
00:20:40.466 --> 00:20:43.066
as the journey continues.
